     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Plurality considers only the top choice of each voter. The percentages for first-place votes show that the Animal Kingdom wins.</p>\n<p>Animal Kingdom: 35%</p>\n<p>Magic Kingdom: 25%</p>\n<p>Epcot: 30%</p>\n<p>Hollywood Studios: no first-place votes</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Animal Kingdom"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 544832,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Ranked-choice method",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A park needs more than 50 percent of the first-place votes to win in the ranked-choice method.</p>\n<p>Animal Kingdom: 35%</p>\n<p>Magic Kingdom: 25%</p>\n<p>Epcot: 30%</p>\n<p>Hollywood Studios: no first-place votes</p>\n<p>No one wins the first round. Eliminate Hollywood Studios and redo the ranks.</p>\n<p>Second Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Percentage of Voters</th>\n<th>35%</th>\n<th>25%</th>\n<th>30%</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Animal Kingdom</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Magic Kingdom</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epcot Center</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Animal Kingdom: 35%</p>\n<p>Magic Kingdom: 25%</p>\n<p>Epcot: 30%</p>\n<p>No one wins. Eliminate Magic Kingdom and redo the ranks.</p>\n<p>Third Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Percentage of Voters</th>\n<th>35%</th>\n<th>25%</th>\n<th>30%</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Animal Kingdom</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epcot Center</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n\n</thead></table>\n<p>Animal Kingdom: 35% + 25% = 60%</p>\n<p>Epcot: 30%</p>\n<p>Animal Kingdom wins.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Animal Kingdom"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 544833,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Borda count",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Percentage of Voters</th>\n<th>35%</th>\n<th>25%</th>\n<th>30%</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Animal Kingdom</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Magic Kingdom</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epcot Center</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hollywood Studios</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>First place gets (4 – 1) = 3 points, second place gets 2 points, third place gets 1 point, and fourth place gets 0 points.</p>\n<p>Animal Kingdom: 35(3) + 25(1) + 30(0) = 130</p>\n<p>Magic Kingdom: 35(2) + 25(3) + 30(1) = 175</p>\n<p>Epcot Center: 35(1) + 25(0) + 30(3) = 125</p>\n<p>Hollywood Studios: 35(0) + 25(3) + 30(3) = 165</p>\n<p>Magic Kingdom wins.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Magic Kingdom"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
